#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:6
msgid "# SAP Overview"
msgstr "# SAP 概述"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "**SAP** (Satellite Application Protocol, version `SAP/1.0`) is the WebSocket JSON protocol between the FreeAnima **Hub** (`anima service`) and **Satellite** processes. Satellites are standalone apps (e.g. pair-programming Studio) that expose their own HTTP UI while delegating agent runtime capabilities to the Hub.\n"
msgstr "**SAP**（Satellite Application Protocol，版本 `SAP/1.0`）是 FreeAnima **Hub**（`anima service`）与 **Satellite** 进程之间的 WebSocket JSON 协议。Satellite 是独立应用（例如 pair-programming Studio），提供自有 HTTP UI，同时将 agent 运行时能力委托给 Hub。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:10
msgid ""
"Schemas and client SDK live in [`packages/sap-contract/`](../../packages/sap-"
"contract/). Hub server implementation: [`platform/src/sap/`](../../platform/"
"src/sap/)."
msgstr ""
"Schema 与客户端 SDK 位于 [`packages/sap-contract/`](../../packages/sap-"
"contract/)。Hub 服务端实现：[`platform/src/sap/`](../../platform/src/sap/)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:12
msgid "## Design goals"
msgstr "## 设计目标"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:16
msgid ""
"**Origin isolation**: the browser talks only to the Satellite HTTP origin; "
"the Hub is reached over a separate WebSocket from the Satellite process."
msgstr ""
"**源隔离**：浏览器仅与 Satellite 的 HTTP 源通信；Hub 由 Satellite 进程通过独"
"立的 WebSocket 连接。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:16
msgid ""
"**Centralized runtime**: sessions, message streaming, PTY terminals, and LLM "
"tool execution run on the Hub; Satellites proxy UI and local tools."
msgstr ""
"**集中式运行时**：会话、消息流、PTY 终端与 LLM 工具执行均在 Hub 上运行；"
"Satellite 代理 UI 与本地工具。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:16
msgid ""
"**Shared contract**: both sides import `@freeanima/sap-contract` for "
"envelopes, RPC types, and `createSapClient` / `runSapTransport`."
msgstr ""
"**共享契约**：双方均导入 `@freeanima/sap-contract`，用于信封、RPC 类型以及 "
"`createSapClient` / `runSapTransport`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:18
msgid "## Topology"
msgstr "## 拓扑"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:37
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"  Browser -->|HTTP| Satellite\n"
"  Satellite -->|WebSocket SAP/1.0| Hub\n"
"  Hub --> Runtime[AgentRuntime]\n"
"  subgraph hubWebUI [Hub WebUI]\n"
"    Parlor[Parlor chat]\n"
"    Chamber[Chamber admin]\n"
"  end\n"
"  Browser -.->|optional| hubWebUI\n"
"  subgraph sapContract [\"@freeanima/sap-contract\"]\n"
"    Protocol[protocol.ts]\n"
"    Frames[frames/*]\n"
"    Client[client.ts]\n"
"  end\n"
"  Satellite -.-> sapContract\n"
"  Hub -.-> sapContract\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"  Browser -->|HTTP| Satellite\n"
"  Satellite -->|WebSocket SAP/1.0| Hub\n"
"  Hub --> Runtime[AgentRuntime]\n"
"  subgraph hubWebUI [Hub WebUI]\n"
"    Parlor[Parlor chat]\n"
"    Chamber[Chamber admin]\n"
"  end\n"
"  Browser -.->|optional| hubWebUI\n"
"  subgraph sapContract [\"@freeanima/sap-contract\"]\n"
"    Protocol[protocol.ts]\n"
"    Frames[frames/*]\n"
"    Client[client.ts]\n"
"  end\n"
"  Satellite -.-> sapContract\n"
"  Hub -.-> sapContract\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Role | Default | Responsibility |\n"
"| ---- | ------- | -------------- |\n"
"| Hub | `http://127.0.0.1:2658` | Agent runtime, SAP WebSocket server at `/sap/v1`, Parlor + Chamber WebUI |\n"
"| Satellite | e.g. `:4173` / `:4174` | Own HTTP UI; outbound SAP connection to Hub |\n"
"| Browser | Satellite origin | Loads Satellite UI; may also open Hub Parlor/Chamber |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 角色 | 默认值 | 职责 |\n"
"| ---- | ------- | -------------- |\n"
"| Hub | `http://127.0.0.1:2658` | Agent 运行时、位于 `/sap/v1` 的 SAP WebSocket 服务器、Parlor + Chamber WebUI |\n"
"| Satellite | 例如 `:4173` / `:4174` | 自有 HTTP UI；向 Hub 发起出站 SAP 连接 |\n"
"| Browser | Satellite 源 | 加载 Satellite UI；也可打开 Hub Parlor/Chamber |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Parlor** and **Chamber** are Hub-only WebUI modes. **Studio** apps (pair-programming) run as Satellites with a dedicated UI origin.\n"
msgstr "**Parlor** 与 **Chamber** 是仅 Hub 提供的 WebUI 模式。**Studio** 应用（pair-programming）作为 Satellite 运行，拥有独立的 UI 源。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:47
msgid ""
"See also: [architecture WebUI section](../concepts/architecture.md#webui)."
msgstr "另见：[architecture WebUI 章节](../concepts/architecture.md#webui)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:49
msgid "## End-to-end happy path"
msgstr "## 端到端成功路径"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Sat->>Hub: connect\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: connected\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req tool.register\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res ok\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req session.create\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res session_id\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req message.send\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res stream_id\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.accepted\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.token\n"
"  Agent->>Hub: invoke sap tool\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt tool.call\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req tool.result\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.tool_result\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.done\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"  Sat->>Hub: connect\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: connected\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req tool.register\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res ok\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req session.create\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res session_id\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req message.send\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res stream_id\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.accepted\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.token\n"
"  Agent->>Hub: invoke sap tool\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt tool.call\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req tool.result\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.tool_result\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.done\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:79
msgid "Satellite opens `ws://{hub}/sap/v1` and sends `connect`."
msgstr "Satellite 打开 `ws://{hub}/sap/v1` 并发送 `connect`。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:79
msgid ""
"Hub replies `connected` and registers the instance in `SatelliteManager`."
msgstr "Hub 回复 `connected`，并在 `SatelliteManager` 中注册该实例。"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:79
msgid "Satellite registers local tools via `tool.register`."
msgstr "Satellite 通过 `tool.register` 注册本地工具。"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:79
msgid ""
"Satellite creates a session; Hub writes `platform_extra.satellite_*` for "
"strict tool routing."
msgstr ""
"Satellite 创建会话；Hub 写入 `platform_extra.satellite_*` 以实现严格的工具路"
"由。"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:79
msgid "`message.send` returns a `stream_id`; Hub pushes `stream.*` events."
msgstr "`message.send` 返回 `stream_id`；Hub 推送 `stream.*` 事件。"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:79
msgid ""
"When the agent calls a Satellite tool, Hub sends `tool.call`; Satellite "
"replies with `tool.result` or `tool.error`."
msgstr ""
"当 agent 调用 Satellite 工具时，Hub 发送 `tool.call`；Satellite 以 "
"`tool.result` 或 `tool.error` 回复。"

